# The audio packs (444 MB) are deliberately not in git — they would bloat the
# repository permanently. Build them locally with build/make_tts_pack.py, or copy
# them to the web host under kural-app/audio/. The app detects their absence via
# data/audio.json and falls back to the device's own speech voices.
audio/
build/__pycache__/
build/_*

# NOTE: data/audio.json is committed as empty ({"chapters":[],"tts":{}}) because no audio
# is deployed from this repository. After copying audio/ to the web host, re-run
# `py build/build_data.py` there (or hand-edit this file) so the app offers the packs.
